1. Land on page; the headline previews what the demo does for motion capture NFTs.
2. The primary action (a live caption strip that types itself as the user speaks, with finalized lines saved as the user pauses) is one tap away; the rest of the layout supports it.
3. After the audio plays / the conversation ends / the transcript commits, the result stays on screen and can be retried or shared.

